          "type": "text",
          "text": "Survey crew considered heavy seasonal rainfall while preparing a capacity check for the sports hall roof model. Roof trusses leave a fixed clearance above the indoor court. The design must also be explained clearly in the safety briefing. A closed cone has radius 6 cm and perpendicular height 8 cm. Find its total surface area in cm², correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 3,
      "primary_outcome": "5.6",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
